  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu shikū jene Ahazi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yotamu, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Uzia, alī ntemi wa Yuda, ntemi Lezini wa Alaamu, na ntemi wa Isilaeli, Peka ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia, bakabūūka kūjūgūdumīla ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu, gīkī balwe nago būlūgū; alīyo bakalemeelwa ū kūgūpyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī numba ya ng'wa Daūdi yūwīlwa, “Ī sī ya Alaamu nī ya Efulaimu jabizile na būsangī”; ī ng'holò yakwe ū Ahazi īkogoha no, hamò nī ng'holò ja banhū bakwe, būyūtingina gītī mitī ya ng'wipoolu īkūtinginyiagwa nyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Isaya gīkī, “Ū bebe jaga nū ng'witūnja wako ū Sheali-yashubu, ūkibone nū Ahazi. Ūkūmanhīja nang'hwe kū nzīla ya kūja kwilaale lya mfuji wa myenda, aho gūgelelile ngoka gwa kūfuma kwilambo lya kū ngūngūli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kang'wīlage gīkī, “Ilang'hanage gete, ūlembeele; yaya ū kogoha. Yaya nūūlū kūfung'wa ng'holò kūlwa nguno ya tūshītinde tūbīlī ūto tūkūdundumūlaga lyochi twenūtū; kūlwa būpelanu būtaale ūbo alīnabo Lezini nī sī ya Alaamu, hamò nū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī Alaamu nī Efulaimu nū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia balī na ng'hūmbū ja kūkwītīla mibi; bakwiwīlaga gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūjagi tūkīdumīle ī Yuda twītūle, twībbalasanye twīgabanhe ībize yise, hama tūntūūle ng'witūnja o ng'wa Tabeeli abize ntemi wayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūlūngalūnga hangī nū Ahazi; ūng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nombage ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wako, akwinhe shimanīkījo; ū bebe lombaga dūhū nūūlū shikabiza shilī kū shimu gītī kūlimu, nūūlū kwigūlya no gīt'igūlū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Ahazi ūhaya, “Ū nene natūlomba, natīko kūngema ū SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaya ūhaya, “Ee bing'we ba numba ya ng'wa Daūdi! Ū gwa kūbaseedeecha banhū mulīgūbona gīkī gūlī mhayo ndo no, nose nū Mulungu wane mutogilwe kūnkoya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū SEEBA wei ngwenekīlī akūng'winha shimanīkījo a bing'we: Munhya ng'wilindu akūbūūcha nda, na akūbyala ng'wana ngosha, ūyo akūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Emmanūli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Emmanūli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Mulungu hamò na bise (ni 8:8).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūshika ng'wikanza lya kūmana kwīlema ī yabūbi na kūsola ītūngīlīgije, akūyūlīīla mabeele maliboto na būūkī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū ng'wana ng'wenūyo aho ataalī kūmana kūyūlema yabūbi na kūsola ītūngīlīgije, ī sī ya batemi babīlī abo ūlībogoha īkūsangwa yasaagile buyīkī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akūkwenhela ū bebe na a banhū bako, na a banhū ba mu numba ya ng'wa so; akūkwenhela ikanza īlo lītaalī kwilonga kūfuma mu lūshikū ūlo Efulaimu īkalekana na Yuda. Akūng'wenha ntemi wa Ashulu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ū SEEBA akūlula nuli, iitane mabbūbbūlū kūfuma kūle kū myongo ya Misili, na nzūkī ja mu sī ya Ashulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a genaya gakwiza gihoolele gikale būlī kwene, ībize mu njonga ī shimu, mu mahalo ga mawe, hose hose būyaga na mu malūla ga kū madīīmīlo a gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, ū SEEBA akwenha lūgembe lwa kūfuma kū nkīlo gwa mongo, h'ū ntemi wa Ashulu. Akūkūmooga ī nzwīlī ja kū ntwe gwako, nū booya ū mu magūlū gako abūpalagute; pye nī ndezu jako akūjifufuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī nīyo ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo, ū munhū akūsaba kang'ombe kamò, na tūkolo tūbīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a mabeelè akūyūpandīka mingī no, nose akūyikala akūlīīlaga mabeelè maliboto dūhū. Nguno pye abo bakūshiigīīla ū mu sī yenīyo, bakūbiza balīīji ba mabeelè maliboto na būūkī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo hangī ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo, būlī kwene ūko gaalīho matina shihūmbī ga mizabibu, īyo yalī īshikile kūmpandīkīla munhū feza shihūmbī, gakūzwa magwaata na ming'hwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ū kūja kwenūko īkūng'wigeleelwa abūūche būta na masonga, nguno pyī ī sī īkokala magwaata na ming'hwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama pyī ī shigūlū īsho shalīmagwa na magembe, atūdūla ū munhū ū kūja koi, kūlwa nguno ya kogoha magwaata na ming'hwa; gakūbiza madīīmīlo ga ng'ombe na ng'holo dūhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
